WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.660
New strict rules have come into force.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:13.860
In Belgrade the accelerated removal of illegal terraces of cafés and restaurants has begun, and municipal inspectors can issue a removal order within only a few hours after an inspection.

3
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:30.080
By a decision of the City Assembly, zero tolerance for the illegal occupation of public areas is introduced, and besides city services removing the terraces of owners who did not remove them on time themselves, considerably increased fines will also be imposed on offenders.
